'A DataSourceParser produces events of these types,' versus 'The events produced by a DataSourceParser are of these types'. IDK. I still lean toward producesEvents. 

But then... dataSourceParsers.stream().map(DataSourceParser::producesEvents) versus dataSourceParsers.stream().map(DataSourceParser::eventsProduced) makes me lean more toward eventsProduced. 

@karianna @kirk-microsoft Please weigh in.
